QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"qq6vsh6ZEshfv4mTdrjA0g","review_id":"6gpxdWiEPEnUz7xkf1Z20A","date":"2019-11-02T16:40:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9348537921905518,"text_excerpt":"Finally tried this place recently near where we live. Overall my experience was pretty good. We had spring rolls and I customized a pho , shrimp add veggies and it was great. I really wish they had a spicy chili oil like most Vietnamese restaurant do but next time I go I will just bring my own! :) Love having this place in the South Market District!"},{"business_id":"qq6vsh6ZEshfv4mTdrjA0g","review_id":"9VtKsVjbtyZJCh4QJp-9Ew","date":"2019-03-01T21:20:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9315456748008728,"text_excerpt":"I L.O.V.E that We finally have a pho place in South market district. I do not know about y'all but pho is how I cure my hangover. Warm rich bone broth, fresh veggies, protein, noodle (but I try not to go hardcore with it)... what else do you need really? I just love that now I can walk to get a pho or any vietnamese food. I have tried their rolls and rice dish too and everything was good. When I ordered rice plate, I asked them to swipe rice for more veggies and they gladly customize it for me without any hassle. To go order is prepared fairly quickly. One thing I am not so fond of is their table arrangements. They are set up so close to each other that it is quite intimidating at some po..."},{"business_id":"qq6vsh6ZEshfv4mTdrjA0g","review_id":"QgFN2KQK9biYi7hZ1jeduQ","date":"2017-04-26T16:59:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9283698201179504,"text_excerpt":"I had the Pho with Brisket. As good a bowl of Pho as I have had, not greasy, not salty... spot on! I didn't taste the banh mi but my colleague raved about it. The bread looks spectacular. Great food in an upscale setting at not upscale prices. What's not to love?! Well now that I ask... the service wasn't bad but it was a little indifferent."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"qq6vsh6ZEshfv4mTdrjA0g","photo_id":"QjUVUJNLplHhXij9o_i4Yg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/QjUVUJNLplHhXij9o_i4Yg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9477764368057251},{"business_id":"qq6vsh6ZEshfv4mTdrjA0g","photo_id":"REXWh8unSiGWMKIw6ib6Fw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/REXWh8unSiGWMKIw6ib6Fw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8989816308021545},{"business_id":"qq6vsh6ZEshfv4mTdrjA0g","photo_id":"gbekVVymaGFzVn6k73gT5g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gbekVVymaGFzVn6k73gT5g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.890891432762146}]},"notebook_case":null}
